;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; ROBINGFN.MAC -- the wide-class sprite glyph font, ZX $9AB3.
;
; A second, separate font from ROBINFNT.MAC's $AC33 (that one is PRINTSTR's
; message/HUD font; this one is $C5FA's -- the glyph-grid sprite drawer used
; by width-class-6 frames like Robin's stick-swing).  Same 8x8, one-bit-per-
; pixel, most-significant-bit-leftmost layout, bit-reversed here the same way,
; so glyph bytes go straight into SHADOWPIX.  Indexed by the glyph code found
; in a frame's 6x5 grid (see L9A76 in ROBINSPR.MAC): code N sits at
; FONTGBASE + N*8., code 0 is reserved (a blank cell, skipped by the drawer).
;
; Extent not yet confirmed against the disassembly -- ported as far as
; transcribed (codes 0-179., ZX $9AB3-$A053).  Codes above this are unknown;
; do not assume 179. is the true last glyph.
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------

FONTG:
